    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/c801fcac825991a1b8498b20b5e56f84.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get easily frustrated, consider giving this game a pass. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get stuck, well... <i>skill issue</i>. Don't worry, it\u2019s not the game, it\u2019s <strong>you</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Git Gud, and victory will taste sweet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, prepare for a rage filled adventure!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die many, <strong>MANY</strong> times. <i>Have fun!</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/20e639b005821ba3bf199fc1e103d63a.poster.avif?t=1753789812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/20e639b005821ba3bf199fc1e103d63a.webm?t=1753789812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/64d293dbb9da5b3316720f32ea8c712e.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ReDrop</strong> is a pixel-art precision platformer where dying isn\u2019t failure, it\u2019s progress. Each death leaves a platform behind to help you overcome obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sounds easy?</i> Just keep dying and you\u2019ll reach the end.<br><br>Except\u2026 your own platforms can also trap you. Easy jumps turn impossible. You might smack your head on a platform you just created. One unlucky death can block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, ready to drop in?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/4f62feece86468eec48aec32189a03e4.poster.avif?t=1753789812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/4f62feece86468eec48aec32189a03e4.webm?t=1753789812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/c10dce967c6a811a030ca4dbbc0bb4a6.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=58 /></span>It all starts inside a strange capsule in a lab, where a mysterious purple slime begins to mutate\u2026 and then <strong>BOOM</strong>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/d62f6e8206b1236d9b19d3cd45c5b443.poster.avif?t=1753789812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/d62f6e8206b1236d9b19d3cd45c5b443.webm?t=1753789812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Suddenly, you\u2019re lost in an unknown world. Explore! Climb through weird environments, dodge deadly traps and creatures, and find your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/a5d6ac68c94757aa7f9a26a83dcb84dc.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s the fate of the little purple slime? Try to unlock all endings, even the secret one, or rage quit trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s harder than it looks, and you\u2019ll die... a lot. Seriously, a <strong>LOT</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you give in to rage before beating them all? <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/cc8e5ae94f0df804cf6f686e52f54cba.poster.avif?t=1753789812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/cc8e5ae94f0df804cf6f686e52f54cba.webm?t=1753789812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/d89da952436d44792d91d7b88bb9cc69.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span>If you really want to suffer, we encourage you to speedrun the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can measure the time you\u2019ve wasted thanks to the in-game timers: one measures the time for the whole gameplay, one resets after every death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So don\u2019t worry! Even if you keep dying for a whole day, you\u2019ll be able to see for how long you weren\u2019t able to complete the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/f10a7f55cee890f977ba7cf170c69492.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/c801fcac825991a1b8498b20b5e56f84.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=104 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get easily frustrated, consider giving this game a pass. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get stuck, well... <i>skill issue</i>. Don't worry, it\u2019s not the game, it\u2019s <strong>you</strong>.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Git Gud, and victory will taste sweet.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Otherwise, prepare for a rage filled adventure!\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will die many, <strong>MANY</strong> times. <i>Have fun!</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/20e639b005821ba3bf199fc1e103d63a.poster.avif?t=1753789812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/20e639b005821ba3bf199fc1e103d63a.webm?t=1753789812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/64d293dbb9da5b3316720f32ea8c712e.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ReDrop</strong> is a pixel-art precision platformer where dying isn\u2019t failure, it\u2019s progress. Each death leaves a platform behind to help you overcome obstacles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sounds easy?</i> Just keep dying and you\u2019ll reach the end.<br><br>Except\u2026 your own platforms can also trap you. Easy jumps turn impossible. You might smack your head on a platform you just created. One unlucky death can block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So, ready to drop in?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/4f62feece86468eec48aec32189a03e4.poster.avif?t=1753789812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/4f62feece86468eec48aec32189a03e4.webm?t=1753789812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/c10dce967c6a811a030ca4dbbc0bb4a6.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=58 /></span>It all starts inside a strange capsule in a lab, where a mysterious purple slime begins to mutate\u2026 and then <strong>BOOM</strong>!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/d62f6e8206b1236d9b19d3cd45c5b443.poster.avif?t=1753789812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/d62f6e8206b1236d9b19d3cd45c5b443.webm?t=1753789812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Suddenly, you\u2019re lost in an unknown world. Explore! Climb through weird environments, dodge deadly traps and creatures, and find your way out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/a5d6ac68c94757aa7f9a26a83dcb84dc.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s the fate of the little purple slime? Try to unlock all endings, even the secret one, or rage quit trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s harder than it looks, and you\u2019ll die... a lot. Seriously, a <strong>LOT</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you give in to rage before beating them all? <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/cc8e5ae94f0df804cf6f686e52f54cba.poster.avif?t=1753789812\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/cc8e5ae94f0df804cf6f686e52f54cba.webm?t=1753789812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/d89da952436d44792d91d7b88bb9cc69.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=83 /></span>If you really want to suffer, we encourage you to speedrun the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can measure the time you\u2019ve wasted thanks to the in-game timers: one measures the time for the whole gameplay, one resets after every death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So don\u2019t worry! Even if you keep dying for a whole day, you\u2019ll be able to see for how long you weren\u2019t able to complete the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3783370/extras/f10a7f55cee890f977ba7cf170c69492.avif?t=1753789812\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "DIE, REDROP, REPEAT. In this Platformer, every Death leaves a platform behind; Climb your mistakes! RAGE, CRY, ADAPT. Then do it all again. Try now and prove you're only *mostly* bad.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese",
